      "content": "2026 Wimble-Done! 🎾🍓 Here are some of the unmissable moments we served up at SW19, in our fourth year as Official Banking Partner of Wimbledon:\n\n· The Clubhouse by Barclays has delivered more than 41,000 customer and fan interactions, bringing people closer to the game through player appearances, rewards, giveaways and interactive experiences.\n\n· We provided over 24,000 free strawberries and cream for our customers.\n\n· The Wimbledon Ticket Resale scheme, supported by Barclays, has already raised almost £280,000 for the Wimbledon Foundation.\n\n· At the Wimbledon Foundation Kiosk, more than 10,000 fans have shared words of encouragement on tennis balls, creating messages of inspiration for young people in our Barclays-supported Set for Success programme.\n\n· We worked with our Barclays Tennis Ambassadors, Billie Jean King and Frances Tiafoe to create their own personalised Wimbledon scents, which were available at The Clubhouse by Barclays for our customers to enjoy.\n \nWe are proud to be the Official Banking Partner of Wimbledon. See you at The Championships next year!",
